<title>SRI LANKA: Weather - Rain seen over southern Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather - Rain seen over southern Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Wednesday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		0</p>
<p>    Canyon		    3.7</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     14.7</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   8.5</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  14.7</p>
<p>    Moussakele		3.9</p>
<p>    Norton		    3.0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     24.7</p>
<p>    Victoria		  4.7</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   46.5</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  18</p>
<p>The department forecasts thunder showers over most of the island during the afternoon or evening.</p>
</text>
